        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tralalero Tralala, Bombardino Crocodilo, Lirili Larila, Tung Tung Tung Sahur – do you recognize these unusual characters?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras/daac97a5149a938f2f1677adc75b82ab.avif?t=1767099400\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras_big/daac97a5149a938f2f1677adc75b82ab.avif?t=1767099400 width=800 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEMOLOGY: ITALIAN BRAINROT</strong> is a new exciting sequel to the famous <strong>MEMOLOGY</strong> game series. In this version, you will not only use your intelligence, but also seriously train your memory, trying to remember all the unique neural network animals of Italian origin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras/5cbd858f9d4d61631908944323fc58a4.avif?t=1767099400\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras_big/5cbd858f9d4d61631908944323fc58a4.avif?t=1767099400 width=800 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have a fascinating journey through the amazing world of virtual creatures, each of which has a special character and unique features. Can you accurately distinguish these characters and name each of them correctly? Let's check your knowledge together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras/ea122ab7e3f1e904ac9925707de3996b.avif?t=1767099400\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras_big/ea122ab7e3f1e904ac9925707de3996b.avif?t=1767099400 width=800 height=86 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic test format in the best traditions of the <strong>MEMOLOGY</strong> series;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 fascinating questions of varying degrees of difficulty;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique achievement system with Italian animals;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting final result: find out which Italian animal YOU are!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An opportunity to evaluate how much time you've wasted studying these amazing creatures (and whether it was worth it...)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Does this challenge seem easy to you?</strong> Dive into the game and test how well you remember these magical creatures. Good luck on your adventure in the world of Italian animals!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tralalero Tralala, Bombardino Crocodilo, Lirili Larila, Tung Tung Tung Sahur – do you recognize these unusual characters?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras/daac97a5149a938f2f1677adc75b82ab.avif?t=1767099400\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras_big/daac97a5149a938f2f1677adc75b82ab.avif?t=1767099400 width=800 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEMOLOGY: ITALIAN BRAINROT</strong> is a new exciting sequel to the famous <strong>MEMOLOGY</strong> game series. In this version, you will not only use your intelligence, but also seriously train your memory, trying to remember all the unique neural network animals of Italian origin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras/5cbd858f9d4d61631908944323fc58a4.avif?t=1767099400\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras_big/5cbd858f9d4d61631908944323fc58a4.avif?t=1767099400 width=800 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have a fascinating journey through the amazing world of virtual creatures, each of which has a special character and unique features. Can you accurately distinguish these characters and name each of them correctly? Let's check your knowledge together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras/ea122ab7e3f1e904ac9925707de3996b.avif?t=1767099400\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras_big/ea122ab7e3f1e904ac9925707de3996b.avif?t=1767099400 width=800 height=86 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic test format in the best traditions of the <strong>MEMOLOGY</strong> series;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 fascinating questions of varying degrees of difficulty;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique achievement system with Italian animals;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting final result: find out which Italian animal YOU are!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An opportunity to evaluate how much time you've wasted studying these amazing creatures (and whether it was worth it...)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Does this challenge seem easy to you?</strong> Dive into the game and test how well you remember these magical creatures. Good luck on your adventure in the world of Italian animals!</p>",
        "short_description": "Tralalero Tralala, Bombardino Crocodilo, Lirili Larila, Tung Tung Tung Sahur – do you recognize these unusual characters? Let's test your knowledge in the new part of the MEMOLOGY series of games - MEMOLOGY: ITALIAN BRAINROT!",
